      "O4"
    ],
    "factor_sequence": [
      "O1",
      "O4"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "If two proteins have the same native structure (TM-score ≈ 1), then their free energy landscapes share that structure as a common minimum (though not necessarily global for both).",
    "motivation": "This introduces a plausible but weaker link: structural similarity suggests the structure is at least a local minimum on both landscapes, based on physical intuition, but stops short of claiming global minima. It acknowledges the gap in the original hypothesis.",
    "depends_on": [
      "O1",
