      "O1"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Two proteins with the same fold (TM-score ≈ 1) have similar free energy landscape topologies near their native states.",
    "motivation": "This proposes a new conjecture linking structural similarity (O4) to thermodynamic similarity, which could bridge the gap in the original hypothesis. It's minimal and checkable via computational studies.",
    "depends_on": [
