      "O4"
    ],
    "factor_sequence": [
      "O4",
      "O1"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "A protein's native structure (per O1) is unique; if another protein has a structure with TM-score ≈ 1 to it, that structure must also be a global minimum on its own landscape for the proteins to be considered homologs.",
    "motivation": "This introduces an additional assumption about homology to bridge the gap, making it a conditional repair. It uses O3 (structure conservation) implicitly, but stays close to the original intent of H2.",
    "depends_on": [
      "O1",
